# Next.js dashboard

App Router. Server Components for reads. Same Supabase project and RLS as mobile.

- Browser client: publishable key only. No `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- Server-side Auth via `@supabase/ssr` cookie pattern when the app exists.
- Recharts for pipeline / spend. Reuse `@tender/shared` status labels.
- Do not add `getServerSideProps` (Pages Router).
